@startuml option_1_failover_sequence
title Вариант 1: push не подтвердился вовремя, переключаемся на SMS
autonumber

queue "Kafka" as kafka
participant "Delivery Orchestrator" as orch
database "PostgreSQL" as db
participant "Push Worker" as push_worker
participant "Push Provider" as push
participant "Retry Scheduler" as scheduler
participant "Outbox Relay" as relay
participant "SMS Worker" as sms_worker
participant "SMS Provider" as sms
participant "Callback Gateway" as callback

orch -> db : create PUSH attempt\ndeadline=now+5s
orch -> kafka : SendPush(attempt_id=P1)
kafka -> push_worker : SendPush(P1)
push_worker -> push : send(idempotency_key=P1)
push --> push_worker : accepted
note over push,callback
  Delivery receipt не пришёл
  до сохранённого deadline.
end note

scheduler -> db : SELECT due attempt\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
scheduler -> db : mark timeout event enqueued + outbox
relay -> db : claim timeout outbox
relay -> kafka : AttemptTimedOut(P1)
kafka -> orch : AttemptTimedOut(P1)
orch -> db : atomic transition:\nWAITING_PUSH -> WAITING_SMS\ncreate SMS attempt S1
orch -> db : INSERT outbox SendSms(S1)
relay -> db : claim SendSms outbox
relay -> kafka : SendSms(S1)
kafka -> sms_worker : SendSms(S1)
sms_worker -> sms : send(idempotency_key=S1)
sms --> sms_worker : accepted
sms -> callback : DELIVERED(S1)
callback -> db : transaction: receipt inbox + outbox
callback --> sms : 204 receipt accepted
relay -> db : claim receipt outbox
relay -> kafka : DeliverySucceeded(S1)
kafka -> orch : DeliverySucceeded(S1)
orch -> db : WAITING_SMS -> DELIVERED\nchannel=SMS

opt поздний push receipt
  push -> callback : DELIVERED(P1)
  callback -> db : transaction: receipt inbox + outbox
  relay -> kafka : DeliverySucceeded(P1)
  kafka -> orch : late result
  orch -> db : append audit; no new transition
  note right of orch
    Уже отправленный SMS отозвать нельзя.
    Условный update не запускает новый канал.
  end note
end
@enduml
